    "name": "Fauneroes",
    "steam_appid": 3093030,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/a55036d9f96b1cd59c83aa2dada7687d.poster.avif?t=1737496493\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/a55036d9f96b1cd59c83aa2dada7687d.webm?t=1737496493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/a55036d9f96b1cd59c83aa2dada7687d.mp4?t=1737496493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overcome Tactical Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat is the heart of the game. Incoming enemy attacks are telegraphed, it's up to you to figure out how to take advantage of their plan. Finding the perfect play every turn is not going to be easy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/79d024aacfdd805b25d2b73660d7619a.poster.avif?t=1737496493\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/79d024aacfdd805b25d2b73660d7619a.webm?t=1737496493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/79d024aacfdd805b25d2b73660d7619a.mp4?t=1737496493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore A Charming World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast forest, populated with many species of wild animals: Squirrels, Foxes, Bears... In this fantasy world, those cute little guys learned to talk to each others, and to take up arms when needed. Will you encounter new allies, or dangerous foes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/335d3ef8354245cd67097abd6a7f3216.poster.avif?t=1737496493\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/335d3ef8354245cd67097abd6a7f3216.webm?t=1737496493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/335d3ef8354245cd67097abd6a7f3216.mp4?t=1737496493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Train Your Dream Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit new unique allies, each with their own visuals and personal skills. Forge them weapons, from swords to daggers or even magic staffs. Unlock new abilities over time, and figure out new ways to make all these work together to create your own playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/1d0344a5475d1075b1ddc97fe346ffcf.poster.avif?t=1737496493\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/1d0344a5475d1075b1ddc97fe346ffcf.webm?t=1737496493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/1d0344a5475d1075b1ddc97fe346ffcf.mp4?t=1737496493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Community Made Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own stories with the built-in map editor &amp; cutscene editor. Share them with other players in game, or try maps of others to never run away of new content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging tactical gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute wildlife animals in armor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete map editor &amp; cutscene editor to create your own stories, or discover endless community made stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming 3D top down graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer online co-op, even if your friends don\u2019t own the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression and leveling, balanced with care to not take anything away from the tactical aspect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful combos and strategies for you to figure out, with near infinite combinations of units, species, skills and weapons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/389555aba815eb3360e98a75c254a288.avif?t=1737496493\" width=610 height=120 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/a55036d9f96b1cd59c83aa2dada7687d.poster.avif?t=1737496493\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/a55036d9f96b1cd59c83aa2dada7687d.webm?t=1737496493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/a55036d9f96b1cd59c83aa2dada7687d.mp4?t=1737496493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overcome Tactical Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat is the heart of the game. Incoming enemy attacks are telegraphed, it's up to you to figure out how to take advantage of their plan. Finding the perfect play every turn is not going to be easy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/79d024aacfdd805b25d2b73660d7619a.poster.avif?t=1737496493\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/79d024aacfdd805b25d2b73660d7619a.webm?t=1737496493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/79d024aacfdd805b25d2b73660d7619a.mp4?t=1737496493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore A Charming World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast forest, populated with many species of wild animals: Squirrels, Foxes, Bears... In this fantasy world, those cute little guys learned to talk to each others, and to take up arms when needed. Will you encounter new allies, or dangerous foes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/335d3ef8354245cd67097abd6a7f3216.poster.avif?t=1737496493\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/335d3ef8354245cd67097abd6a7f3216.webm?t=1737496493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/335d3ef8354245cd67097abd6a7f3216.mp4?t=1737496493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Train Your Dream Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit new unique allies, each with their own visuals and personal skills. Forge them weapons, from swords to daggers or even magic staffs. Unlock new abilities over time, and figure out new ways to make all these work together to create your own playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/1d0344a5475d1075b1ddc97fe346ffcf.poster.avif?t=1737496493\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/1d0344a5475d1075b1ddc97fe346ffcf.webm?t=1737496493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/1d0344a5475d1075b1ddc97fe346ffcf.mp4?t=1737496493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Community Made Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own stories with the built-in map editor &amp; cutscene editor. Share them with other players in game, or try maps of others to never run away of new content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging tactical gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute wildlife animals in armor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete map editor &amp; cutscene editor to create your own stories, or discover endless community made stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming 3D top down graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer online co-op, even if your friends don\u2019t own the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression and leveling, balanced with care to not take anything away from the tactical aspect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful combos and strategies for you to figure out, with near infinite combinations of units, species, skills and weapons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093030/extras/389555aba815eb3360e98a75c254a288.avif?t=1737496493\" width=610 height=120 /></span></p>",
